# armour/shared/pauldron_vented3_r: the medium VENTED pauldron on the right shoulder (vented.3; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# a broad flat-topped stack of heavy lames like a stove's grate, a dark vent slit under every lit lip (FURNACE,
# emberforged); the slits are its seams (they glow at T5).
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the top lip, G the middle lip's rivet, N the vent slits, P the lips.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Redrawn by BODY i2 mass2.py (a boxy spaulder on the shoulder, not a plank; re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron vented.3
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

view D key rest origin 4 2
|..vvvv..
|.vyzywv.
|vyzyyxwv
|vwwwwwwv
|vyyyxxwv
|vwwwwwwv
|.vvvvvv.
regions
|........
|..RRRR..
|.RRRRRR.
|.NNNNNN.
|.PPPPPP.
|.NNNNNN.
|........
